---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms and Conditions | Arkansas Property Buyers"
  description="Terms and Conditions for using the Arkansas Property Buyers LLC website, including our text messaging (SMS) terms."
>

<!-- HEADER -->
<Header />

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="bg-navy pt-16 pb-14 sm:pt-20 sm:pb-16">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8 text-center">
    <p class="eyebrow tracking-widest mb-4">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-white uppercase leading-tight text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-4">Terms and Conditions</h1>
    <p class="font-body text-white/70 text-sm">Last updated: July 15, 2026</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CONTENT -->
<section class="bg-white py-14 sm:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8">

      <div>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">These Terms and Conditions ("Terms") govern your use of arkansaspropertybuyers.com (the "Site"), operated by Arkansas Property Buyers LLC ("Arkansas Property Buyers," "we," "us," or "our"). By using the Site or submitting a form, you agree to these Terms.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">Use of the Site</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">The Site is provided to help homeowners learn about their options and request information about selling a property to Arkansas Property Buyers. You agree to provide accurate information when submitting a form and to use the Site only for lawful purposes.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">No Guarantee of Offer</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Submitting a form on this Site does not guarantee that we will make an offer on your property, nor does it obligate you to accept any offer we may make. Any cash offer is subject to our evaluation of your property and is not final until confirmed in a separate written agreement.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">Text Message (SMS) Terms</h2>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2 mb-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">When submitting a form, you may choose to opt in to receive transactional text messages (related to your inquiry, requested information, and appointment scheduling), promotional and educational text messages, both, or neither.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Consent to receive text messages is not a condition of selling your property to us or receiving any of our services.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply, based on your mobile carrier plan.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">You may opt out of text messages at any time by replying STOP to any message you receive from us.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">You may reply HELP at any time to receive assistance, or call us directly at <a href="tel:+15015047109" class="text-orange hover:text-gold transition-colors font-bold">(501) 504-7109</a>.</p>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-orange flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
            <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm">Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">For more information about how we handle the information collected through text messaging consent, see our <a href="/privacy/" class="text-orange hover:text-gold transition-colors font-bold">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">All content on this Site, including text, graphics, and logos, is the property of Arkansas Property Buyers LLC unless otherwise noted, and may not be copied or used without our permission.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">The Site and its content are provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. Arkansas Property Buyers LLC is not liable for any damages arising from your use of the Site, to the fullest extent permitted by law.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">Governing Law</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Arkansas, without regard to its conflict of law provisions.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">We may update these Terms from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with a revised "Last updated" date.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-navy uppercase text-xl leading-tight mb-3">Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-grey text-sm leading-relaxed">Arkansas Property Buyers LLC<br>2024 Arkansas Valley Dr., Ste 407<br>Little Rock, Arkansas 72212<br><a href="tel:+15015047109" class="text-orange hover:text-gold transition-colors font-bold">(501) 504-7109</a></p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<Footer />

</Layout>
